<!DOCTYPE html>

<!-- Dreamweaver template for the Weightlifting Friends coaching page.
     Everything outside the editable regions is the locked design baseline.
     Change the design here; Dreamweaver then updates index.html. -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"/><!-- LAUNCH: delete this line (and robots.txt) when the page is ready -->
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="doctitle" --><title>Weightlifting Friends | Coaching</title><!-- TemplateEndEditable -->
<meta content="One-to-one Olympic weightlifting coaching from a USA Weightlifting national-level coach who still competes. The remote team of Collective Weightlifting." name="description"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;700&amp;family=Archivo:wdth,wght@62..125,400..900&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
  /* ===== The Turnover Creative palette =====
     A · Platform Journal (base): newsprint, ink, chalk, signal red
     B · Warm-Up Room (meet-day accents): black, photocopy, riso pink, federation blue
     Pink is a spot colour on black only (fails contrast on paper). */
  :root {
    --newsprint: #F2EFE8;
    --ink: #111111;
    --chalk: #C9C6BF;
    --grey: #6E6B65;
    --red: #B5281F;
    --black: #0E0E0E;
    --photocopy: #EDEDE8;
    --pink: #FF48B0;
    --blue: #0047BB;
    --serif: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif;
    --sans: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    --cond: 'Archivo', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    --max: 1200px;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { background: var(--newsprint); color: var(--ink); font: 17px/1.55 var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
  .wrap { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  .mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .num { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .serif { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; }
  .bw { filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.12); }
  .natural { filter: saturate(.85) contrast(1.04); }
  .rule { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .cap { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--grey); margin-top: 8px; }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 24px; font: 600 15px var(--sans); text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--ink); transition: background .15s, color .15s; }
  .btn-ink { background: var(--ink); color: var(--newsprint); }
  .btn-ink:hover { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); }
  .btn-line:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--newsprint); }

  /* ===== Masthead ===== */
  .topline { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--chalk); }
  .topline .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; }
  .topline .mono { font-size: 11px; }
  .masthead { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .masthead .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; padding-top: 22px; padding-bottom: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .wm-friends { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px); line-height: 1; text-decoration: none; }
  .cobrand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none; }
  .cobrand .x { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--grey); }
  .wm-turnover { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  .wm-turnover b { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; }
  .wm-turnover i { font-family: var(--mono); font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .42em; line-height: 1; }
  .brandrow { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .nav { display: flex; gap: 22px; align-items: center; }
  .nav a { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; }
  .nav a:hover { color: var(--red); }
  .nav .apply { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red); }

  /* ===== Hero ===== */
  .hero { padding: 48px 0 64px; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; gap: 48px; align-items: stretch; }
  .hero h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(54px, 8.4vw, 116px); line-height: .92; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin: 18px 0 26px; }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; }
  .lead { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 34ch; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .paths { margin-top: 36px; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .paths a { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr auto; align-items: center; min-height: 52px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--chalk); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
  .paths a span:first-child { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--grey); }
  .paths a span:last-child { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--red); }
  .paths a:hover { color: var(--red); }
  .hero-photo { position: relative; min-height: 560px; }
  .hero-photo img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 38% 50%; }
  .hero-photo figcaption { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: -28px; }

  /* ===== Proof (results-table style) ===== */
  .proof { padding: 56px 0; }
  .proof-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 12px; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .proof-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr .8fr; align-items: baseline; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--chalk); gap: 16px; }
  .proof-row:last-child { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .proof-row .serif { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 42px); line-height: 1; }
  .proof-row .who { font-size: 15px; color: var(--grey); }
  .proof-row .res { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--red); font-weight: 500; text-align: right; }

  /* ===== Story (feature spread) ===== */
  .story { padding: 72px 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr; gap: 56px; }
  .story-photo img { width: 100%; height: 640px; object-fit: cover; }
  .kicker { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--chalk); padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .story h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px); line-height: .98; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .story-cols { column-count: 2; column-gap: 32px; font-size: 17px; }
  .story-cols p { margin-bottom: 14px; break-inside: avoid-column; }
  .story-cols p:first-child::first-letter { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 4.2em; float: left; line-height: .82; padding: 6px 8px 0 0; }
  .pull { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 38px); line-height: 1.15; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); padding: 22px 0; margin: 28px 0 18px; }
  .byline { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .08em; }

  /* ===== Segments ===== */
  .segments { padding: 72px 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .sec-title { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .sec-title h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px); line-height: .98; }
  .seg-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
  .seg { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .seg-anchor { display: block; position: relative; top: -24px; visibility: hidden; }
  .seg img { width: 100%; height: 340px; object-fit: cover; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .seg .mono { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 12px; }
  .seg h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; margin: 12px 0 14px; }
  .seg p { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .seg .goal { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--chalk); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; }
  .seg .goal b { color: var(--red); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ===== B · Warm-Up Room: meet day ===== */
  .wur { background: var(--black); color: var(--photocopy); padding: 80px 0 88px; overflow: hidden; }
  .wur-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; border-bottom: 6px solid var(--photocopy); padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 44px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .wur h2 { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 62%; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: clamp(48px, 11vw, 150px); line-height: .84; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .wur h2 span { color: var(--pink); }
  .tag { display: inline-block; font: 700 15px var(--mono); padding: 6px 12px; }
  .tag-pink { background: var(--pink); color: var(--black); transform: rotate(-2deg); }
  .tag-blue { background: var(--blue); color: var(--photocopy); transform: rotate(1.5deg); }
  .tag-paper { background: var(--photocopy); color: var(--black); }
  .wur-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: start; }
  .collage { position: relative; height: 620px; }
  .collage .duo { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 74%; height: 470px; background: var(--pink); overflow: hidden; transform: rotate(-1.5deg); }
  .collage .duo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 40% 50%; filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.6) brightness(1.05); mix-blend-mode: multiply; }
  .collage .copy { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; width: 52%; height: 300px; border: 8px solid var(--photocopy); overflow: hidden; transform: rotate(3deg); }
  .collage .copy img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 30% 50%; filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.6); }
  .collage .tag { position: absolute; left: 18px; bottom: 120px; z-index: 2; }
  .wur-lead { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.45; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .wur-list { list-style: none; border-top: 2px solid var(--photocopy); }
  .wur-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr; gap: 8px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3A3A3A; }
  .wur-list .n { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 62%; font-size: 40px; line-height: .9; color: var(--pink); }
  .wur-list b { display: block; font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 75%; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: .01em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .wur-list p { font-size: 15.5px; color: #CFCFC9; }

  /* ===== Plans ===== */
  .plans { padding: 80px 0; }
  .plan-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .plan { padding: 28px 28px 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-right: 1px solid var(--chalk); }
  .plan:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .plan.featured { background: var(--ink); color: var(--newsprint); border-right: none; position: relative; }
  .plan.featured .mono, .plan.featured .for { color: var(--chalk); }
  .plan.featured li { border-color: #3A3A3A; }
  .plan.featured .btn { background: var(--newsprint); color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--newsprint); }
  .plan.featured .btn:hover { background: var(--pink); border-color: var(--pink); }
  .plan .badge { position: absolute; top: -16px; right: 24px; }
  .plan h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; margin: 12px 0 10px; }
  .price { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 500; }
  .price small { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; }
  .for { font-size: 15px; color: var(--grey); margin: 8px 0 18px; }
  .plan ul { list-style: none; flex: 1; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .plan li { padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--chalk); font-size: 15px; }
  .audit { margin-top: 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: center; padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--chalk); }
  .audit .serif { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; }
  .audit p { font-size: 15.5px; }

  /* ===== Steps ===== */
  .steps { padding: 72px 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .step-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .step { padding: 18px 18px 0 0; }
  .step .n { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--red); }
  .step h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.05; margin: 8px 0; }
  .step p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--grey); }

  /* ===== Community ===== */
  .community { padding: 72px 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .com-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: end; }
  .com-grid img { width: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .com-a { height: 520px; }
  .com-b { height: 380px; }
  .com-text h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(40px, 4.6vw, 64px); line-height: .98; margin: 14px 0 18px; }
  .com-text p { font-size: 18px; }

  /* ===== FAQ ===== */
  .faq { padding: 72px 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 48px; }
  .faq h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: .98; }
  details { border-top: 1px solid var(--chalk); }
  details:last-child { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  details:first-child { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; min-height: 56px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::after { content: "+"; font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--red); font-size: 22px; }
  details[open] summary::after { content: "–"; }
  details p { padding-bottom: 18px; color: #3A3835; }

  /* ===== CTA (B mode) ===== */
  .cta { background: var(--black); color: var(--photocopy); padding: 88px 0 96px; text-align: center; }
  .cta h2 { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 62%; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: clamp(44px, 9vw, 128px); line-height: .86; overflow-wrap: anywhere; margin: 22px 0 18px; }
  .cta p { color: #CFCFC9; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .cta .btn { background: var(--pink); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--pink); }
  .cta .btn:hover { background: var(--photocopy); border-color: var(--photocopy); }
  .cta .btn-line { background: transparent; color: var(--photocopy); border-color: var(--photocopy); }
  .cta .btn-line:hover { background: var(--photocopy); color: var(--black); }
  .cta .actions { justify-content: center; }

  /* ===== Footer co-brand ===== */
  footer { padding: 40px 0 48px; }
  .foot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: center; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 24px; }
  .foot .serif { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; }
  .t-icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; justify-self: center; }
  .t-icon span { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; color: var(--newsprint); display: inline-block; transform: translateY(.03em) rotate(-12deg); transform-origin: 50% .84em; }
  .foot-r { justify-self: end; text-align: right; }
  .foot-fine { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 20px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--grey); }

  /* ===== Responsive ===== */
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero-grid, .story-grid, .wur-grid, .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
    .hero-photo { min-height: 440px; order: -1; }
    .hero-photo figcaption { position: static; }
    .story-photo img { height: 420px; }
    .seg-grid, .plan-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .plan { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--chalk); }
    .plan.featured { order: -1; }
    .step-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 20px; }
    .com-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .com-text { grid-column: 1 / -1; order: -1; }
    .com-a, .com-b { height: 300px; }
    .audit { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .nav a:not(.apply) { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .story-cols { column-count: 1; }
    .proof-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
    .proof-row .who { grid-column: 1 / -1; order: 3; }
    .collage { height: 470px; }
    .collage .duo { width: 86%; height: 340px; }
    .collage .copy { width: 58%; height: 210px; }
    .collage .tag { bottom: 70px; }
    .step-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .foot { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: left; }
    .t-icon { justify-self: start; }
    .foot-r { justify-self: start; text-align: left; }
    .btn { width: 100%; }
    .topline .mono:last-child { display: none; }
  }
  /* template helpers */
  .warm { filter: sepia(.2) saturate(.88) contrast(.96); }
  .plan.featured .btn-line { background: var(--newsprint); color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--newsprint); }
  .plan.featured .btn-line:hover { background: var(--pink); border-color: var(--pink); color: var(--black); }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .unused-preview-bar { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 99; padding: 12px 20px; font: 600 14px var(--mono); color: #fff; }
</style>
<!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="head" --><!-- TemplateEndEditable --><!-- TemplateParam name="turnoverLink" type="URL" value="TURNOVER_LINK" -->
</head>
<body>
<div class="topline">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="mono"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="toplineLeft" -->Olympic weightlifting coaching · Pacific Northwest &amp; remote<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></span>
<span class="mono"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="toplineRight" -->The remote team of Collective Weightlifting<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></span>
</div>
</div>
<header class="masthead">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="brandrow">
<a class="wm-friends" href="#">Weightlifting Friends</a>
<a aria-label="With The Turnover Creative" class="cobrand" href="@@(turnoverLink)@@">
<span class="x">×</span>
<span class="wm-turnover"><b>The Turnover</b><i>CREATIVE</i></span>
</a>
</div>
<nav aria-label="Main" class="nav"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="navLinks" -->
<a href="#meet-day">Meet day</a>
<a href="#plans">Coaching</a>
<a href="#faq">Questions</a>
<a class="apply" href="APPLY_LINK">Apply</a>
<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></nav>
</div>
</header>
<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div>
<div class="mono"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="heroLabel" -->One-to-one coaching · Issue 01<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></div>
<h1><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="heroHeadline" --><span>I'll see you in the</span> <em>warm-up room.</em><!-- TemplateEndEditable --></h1>
<p class="lead"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="heroIntro" -->Coaching from a USA Weightlifting national-level coach who still competes. Our team travels to USA Weightlifting national meets, so if you're lifting there, you won't be warming up alone.<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></p>
<div class="actions"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="heroButtons" -->
<a class="btn btn-ink" href="APPLY_LINK">Apply for coaching</a>
<a class="btn btn-line" href="#plans">Ways to train</a>
<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></div>
<nav aria-label="Choose your path" class="paths"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="heroPaths" -->
<a href="#competitive"><span>01</span><span>I'm chasing a qualifying total</span><span>→</span></a>
<a href="#masters"><span>02</span><span>I'm a masters lifter</span><span>→</span></a>
<a href="#crossfit"><span>03</span><span>I'm coming from CrossFit</span><span>→</span></a>
<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></nav>
</div>
<figure class="hero-photo"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="heroPhoto" -->
<img alt="Masters lifter in the receiving position of a snatch" class="bw" src="../images/hero-snatch.jpg" style="object-position:38% 50%"/>
<figcaption class="cap">Photo · The Turnover Creative</figcaption>
<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></figure>
</div>
</section>
<!-- RESULTS -->
<section class="proof">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="proof-head">
<span class="mono"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="resultsLabel" -->Results · athletes developed on this team<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></span>
<span class="mono" style="color:var(--grey)"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="resultsNote" -->Qualified to compete<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></span>
</div>
<div>
<!-- TemplateBeginRepeat name="results" --><div class="proof-row"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="resultRow" --><span class="serif">Junior Nationals</span><span class="who">Youth and junior lifters, first meet to national stage</span><span class="res">QUALIFIED</span><!-- TemplateEndEditable --></div>
<!-- TemplateEndRepeat -->
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- STORY -->
<section class="story">
<div class="wrap story-grid">
<figure class="story-photo"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="storyPhoto" -->
<img alt="Lifter chalking up at the chalk bowl" class="bw" src="../images/masters-chalk.jpg"/>
<figcaption class="cap">Waiting is part of the story.</figcaption>
<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></figure>
<div>
<div class="mono kicker"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="storyLabel" -->Feature · Why I coach<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></div>
<h2><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="storyHeadline" -->Ten years waiting for coaching I could get to.<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></h2>
<div class="story-cols"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="storyText" -->
<p>I fell in love with weightlifting at a time when there was nowhere near me to learn it properly. No high-level coaches, no real facilities. It took about ten years, getting through college and watching CrossFit put barbells in gyms everywhere, before proper weightlifting was somewhere I could actually train.</p>
<p>My first meet gave me something I'd been missing. I'd always been a competitive team-sport athlete, and always harder on myself than on anyone else. I could accept a teammate's bad day long before I'd accept my own.</p>
<p>That's what I coach for now: real coaching for lifters who don't live next door to it, and a sport where what you put in is what shows up on the scoresheet.</p>
<p>I'm still competing myself, so I know what your training week feels like, and I know what the back room feels like on meet day.</p>
<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></div>
<p class="pull"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="storyQuote" -->“On the platform, the outcome was fully mine.”<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></p>
<p class="byline"><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="storySignature" -->Jacob Howard · USA Weightlifting National Level Coach<!-- TemplateEndEditable --></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
