<img alt="Two lifters in the bottom of a snatch during a meet session" class="natural" src="../images/session-snatch.jpg"/>
<span class="mono">01 · Competitive</span>
<h3>Chasing a qualifying total</h3>
<div>
<p>You know the total you need, the class you'll lift in and when the window closes. What's usually missing is someone watching every session and changing next week because of what they saw.</p>
<p>We plan your block backward from your meet and your class.</p>
</div>
<p class="goal"><b>GOAL</b> <span>The total, on the day it counts.</span></p>
