<div>
<!-- TemplateBeginRepeat name="faq" --><details><!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="faqItem" --><summary>Can remote coaching really fix my technique?</summary><p>It works when the feedback is fast and specific. You film your key sets from a side or 45° angle, and you get a reply within a day about the exact lift, not a general note. If you're near the gym, you can add in-person sessions too.</p><!-- TemplateEndEditable --></details>
